OL,3,GNEWSASteepest street made one-way for
OL,4,Apublic safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire's steepest street has been
OL,7,Fmade one-way to see if it makes it
OL,8,Fsafer.
OL,10,FBamford Clough has an average gradient
OL,11,Fof 1 in 5, with some sections more than
OL,12,F1 in 3, said Derbyshire County Council,
OL,13,Fwhile the narrow, walled route has no
OL,14,Fpassing places.
OL,16,FThis means drivers risk getting stuck
OL,17,For losing control, and have limited
OL,18,Fvisibility to spot oncoming vehicles,
OL,19,Fsaid the council.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
